= Changelog <main:CHANGELOG-0.6.x>


All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on #link("https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/")[Keep a Changelog];.

== 0.6.12 (2022-12-27)


=== Added


Graphics module:

First big step to do plot 2D and 3D with Nelson. Some features are missing and will come in next releases.
Current version is usable and show plots possibilities of Nelson.

Do not hesitate to create features requests or bug reports. Contributions are welcome.

Implemented features:

- #raw("figure"); creates an figure window.
- #raw("cla"); clears figure.
- #raw("axes"); creates cartesian axes.
- #raw("axis"); set axis limits and aspect ratios.
- #raw("cla"); clears axes.
- #raw("zlim"); set or get z-axis limits.
- #raw("ylim"); set or get y-axis limits.
- #raw("xlim"); set or get x-axis limits.
- #raw("clim"); set colormap limits.
- #raw("line"); creates primitive line.
- #raw("plot"); 2-D line plot.
- #raw("plot3"); 3-D line plot.
- #raw("rgbplot"); Plot colormap.
- #raw("subplot"); Create axes in tiled positions.
- #raw("newplot"); Prepare to produce a new plot.
- #raw("semilogx"); Semilog plot (x-axis has log scale).
- #raw("semilogy"); Semilog plot (y-axis has log scale).s
- #raw("quiver"); Quiver or vector plot.
- #raw("surf"); creates surface plot.
- #raw("text"); creates text descriptions to data points.
- #raw("title"); adds title.
- #raw("legend"); adds legend to axes.
- #raw("xlabel"); Label x-axis.
- #raw("ylabel"); Label y-axis.
- #raw("zlabel"); Label z-axis.
- #raw("grid"); Display or hide axes grid lines.
- #raw("spy"); Visualize sparsity pattern of matrix.
- #raw("image"); displays image from array.
- #raw("imagesc"); displays image from array with scaled colors.
- #raw("cylinder"); creates cylinder.
- #raw("sphere"); creates sphere.
- #raw("close"); close one or more figures.
- #raw("gcf"); get current figure graphics object.
- #raw("gca"); get current axes graphics object.
- #raw("groot"); return graphic root object.
- #raw("refresh"); redraws current figure.
- #raw("ishold"); get current hold state.
- #raw("hold"); retain current plot when adding new plots.
- #raw("view"); Camera line of sigh.
- #raw("saveas"); Save figure to specific file format.
- #raw("copygraphics"); Copy plot to clipboard.
- #raw("isValidGraphicsProperty"); check property name is valid for a graphics object type name.
- #raw("isprop");, #raw("properties");, #raw("isequal");, #raw("eq");, #raw("display");, #raw("set");, #raw("get"); for Graphics Object type.
- #raw("isgraphics"); Check if it is an graphics object handles.
- #raw("colstyle"); Parse color and style from string.
- #raw("is2D"); Checks if ax is a 2-D Polar or Cartesian axes.
- #raw("colorbar"); Colorbar showing color scale.
- #raw("colormap"); View and set current colormap.
- colormaps:
  - #raw("autumn");: Autumn colormap array.
  - #raw("gray");: Gray colormap array.
  - #raw("parula");: Parula colormap array.
  - #raw("spring");: Spring colormap array.
  - #raw("summer");: Summer colormap array.
  - #raw("winter");: Winter colormap array.

