== 0.6.11 (2022-11-25)


=== Added


- #raw("normest"); 2-norm estimate.

- logical operators #raw("&");, #raw("|"); , #raw("&&");, #raw("||"); for sparses matrix managed.

- doxygen documentation generated by Github CI for each release.

- #raw("--noaudio"); CLI argument disable audio (module) in Nelson.

- #link("https://github.com/nelson-lang/nelson/issues/783")[\#783];: Fedora 37 support.

- an example to build mexFunction using Rust.

- geometry module:

  - #raw("rotx");: 3x3 transformation matrix for rotations around x-axis
  - #raw("roty");: 3x3 transformation matrix for rotations around y-axis
  - #raw("rotz");: 3x3 transformation matrix for rotations around z-axis

- #raw("spones"); replaces non zero sparse matrix elements with ones.

- #raw("rot90"); faster for 2D matrix.

=== Changed


- timeout #raw("--timeout"); CLI argument and #raw("system"); with timeout return error code #raw("258"); on Windows and #raw("134"); others platforms.

- #raw("test_run"); catches error code about test aborted (timeout).

- #raw("exit"); does not allow value \> 255 on Linux and MacOS.

- #link("https://github.com/nelson-lang/nelson/issues/776")[\#776];: internal dependencies between modules reworked.

- Uses MKL or OpenBlas if detected on linux and MacOs (Nelson is faster on Linux and MacOs).

=== Fixed


- basic terminal was closed immediately if stdin was null.

- Github Actions CI warnings.

- #link("https://github.com/nelson-lang/nelson/issues/778")[\#778];: ArchLinux Github CI was broken.

== 0.6.10 (2022-10-31)


=== Added


- #link("https://github.com/nelson-lang/nelson/issues/750")[\#750];: Qt 6.4.0 support (win64 release embed Qt6.4.0).

- #link("https://github.com/nelson-lang/nelson/issues/733")[\#733];: minimal build and optional installation on MacOs, Linux and Windows.

