== 0.6.9 (2022-09-28)


=== Added


- linear algebra module:

  - #raw("rref");: Gauss-Jordan elimination.
  - #raw("orth");: Range space of a matrix.
  - #raw("subspace");: Angle between two subspaces.
  - #raw("planerot");: Givens plane rotation.
  - #raw("condeig");: Condition number with respect to eigenvalues.
  - #raw("bandwidth");: Lower and upper matrix bandwidth.
  - #raw("isbanded");: Determine if matrix is within specific bandwidth.

- audio module:

  - #raw("sound");: Convert matrix of signal data to sound and play it.
  - #raw("soundsc");: Scale data and play as sound.
  - #raw("mu2lin");: Convert audio data from mu-law to linear signal.
  - #raw("lin2mu");: Convert audio data from linear signal to mu-law.

- elementary functions module:

  - #raw("toeplitz");: Toeplitz matrix.
  - #raw("hadamard");: Hadamard matrix.
  - #raw("wilkinson");: Wilkinson's eigenvalue test matrix.
  - #raw("vander");: Vandermonde matrix.
  - #raw("rosser");: Classic symmetric eigenvalue test problem.
  - #raw("nextpow2");: Next higher power of 2.
  - #raw("permute");: Permute array dimensions.
  - #raw("ipermute");: Inverse permute array dimensions.
  - #raw("rot90");: Rotate array 90 degrees.

- special functions module:

  - #raw("dot");: Dot product.
  - #raw("cross");: Cross product.

- string module:

  - #raw("isletter");: Determine which characters are letters.

- data analysis module:

  - #raw("cumsum");: Cumulative sum.
  - #raw("cumprod");: Cumulative product.

=== Changed


- #link("https://github.com/nelson-lang/nelson/issues/715")[\#715];: update #raw("{fmt}"); to 9.1.0.

- Nelson uses #link("https://github.com/simdutf/simdutf")[#raw("simdutf");]; library to convert characters encoding faster.

- shortcuts #raw("&&"); and #raw("||"); reworked.

- assign behavior with empty matrix.

- #link("https://github.com/nelson-lang/nelson/issues/702")[\#702];: Ubuntu 18.04 CI removed on Github.

- Remove definitively Appveyor CI.

- C++ API: #raw("getContentAsDoubleScalar");, #raw("getContentAsSingleScalar");, #raw("getContentAsInteger8Scalar");, ... , #raw("getContentAsInteger64Scalar"); can check if it is an integer value.

- #raw("addgateway");, #raw("removegateway");, #raw("gatewayinfo"); builtin moved in #raw("modules_manager"); module (reduces dependency)

=== Fixed


- #link("https://github.com/nelson-lang/nelson/issues/722")[\#722];: MS MPI runtime v10.1.2.

- #link("https://github.com/nelson-lang/nelson/issues/723")[\#723];: MacOS CI was broken.

- #link("https://github.com/nelson-lang/nelson/issues/737")[\#737];: profiler failed with #raw("sind"); example.

- #link("https://github.com/nelson-lang/nelson/issues/739")[\#739];: special case with empty cell.

- #link("https://github.com/nelson-lang/nelson/issues/741")[\#741];: #raw("ones"); and #raw("zeros"); do not manager logical as typename.

== 0.6.8 (2022-08-27)


=== Added


- #link("https://github.com/nelson-lang/nelson/issues/574")[\#573];: #raw("diff"); differences and discret derivatives.

- #raw("peaks");: peaks function.

- parallel module:

