  - #raw("atand");: Inverse tangent in degrees.
  - #raw("atan2d");: Four-quadrant inverse tangent in degrees.
  - #raw("sinpi");: Computes sin(X \\\* pi) accurately.
  - #raw("cospi");: Computes cos(X \\\* pi) accurately.
  - #raw("asind");: Inverse sine in degrees.
  - #raw("asinh");: Inverse hyperbolic sine.
  - #raw("acosh");: Inverse hyperbolic cosine.
  - #raw("acosd");: Inverse cosine in degrees.
  - #raw("acoth");: Inverse hyperbolic cotangent.
  - #raw("acsc");: Inverse cosecant in radians.
  - #raw("acscd");: Inverse cosecant in degrees.
  - #raw("acsch");: Inverse hyperbolic cosecant.
  - #raw("asec");: Inverse secant in radians.
  - #raw("asecd");: Inverse secant in degrees.
  - #raw("asech");: Inverse hyperbolic secant.
  - #raw("acot");: Inverse cotangent in radians.
  - #raw("acotd");: Inverse cotangent in degrees.

- prettier is used to format .xml, .md files.

- Code format (.xml, .md, c++) checker added to Github CI.

=== Changed


- #raw("system"); builtin:

  - returns time execution
  - timeout input argument can be set to kill process after n seconds.

- #link("https://github.com/nelson-lang/nelson/issues/687")[\#687];: Uses BS thread pool 3.3.0.

- Windows 32 bits threads support: due to threading limitations with MKL, openMP and others threads
